# An entry/window-only GTK baseline reproduces Fontconfig retention on Ubuntu
# 24.04 arm64. amd64 CI additionally reports 56 bytes from AT-SPI initialization
# when its accessibility bus is unavailable. Keep these origins specific;
# never suppress g_malloc, all of GTK, or application symbols.
leak:libfontconfig.so
leak:atk_bridge_adaptor_init

# GTK 3.24.41 gtkpathbar.c:1888 allocates parent_file, then :1898 overwrites
# it without releasing it. A standalone file chooser reproduces the leak.
# Debug symbols are required so this matches only the affected GTK function.
# https://github.com/GNOME/gtk/blob/3.24.41/gtk/gtkpathbar.c#L1888
leak:_gtk_path_bar_set_file
